stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> SCHEDULED: instance created for registration and period, due date computed
    SCHEDULED --> BLOCKED: guard fails, reason owner and trigger recorded
    BLOCKED --> SCHEDULED: guard clears
    SCHEDULED --> GENERATED: artefact built from the locked snapshot, format version and sha256 stored
    GENERATED --> VALIDATED: format checks pass
    VALIDATED --> SUBMITTED: attended upload, session and written authority recorded
    SUBMITTED --> REJECTED: reasons captured per member
    REJECTED --> GENERATED: new attempt, same snapshot unless figures changed
    SUBMITTED --> ACCEPTED: acknowledgement stored
    ACCEPTED --> REVISED: ECR only while no payment initiated
    FILED --> REVISED: Form 138 correction statement
    REVISED --> ACCEPTED: revision accepted, diff kept
    REVISED --> FILED: correction accepted
    ACCEPTED --> SUPPLEMENTARY: members absent from every prior return
    FILED --> SUPPLEMENTARY: members absent from every prior return
    SUPPLEMENTARY --> FILED: accepted and receipted
    ACCEPTED --> PAYMENT_INITIATED: month gate passed, challan with TRRN
    PAYMENT_INITIATED --> FILED: receipt stored and reconciled
    ACCEPTED --> FILED: no payment leg
    FILED --> [*]

    note right of GENERATED
        Every attempt is a new record linked to the prior one.
        Nothing is overwritten - a correction is a diff.
        Canonical table in 08 FR-PAY-711.
    end note
    note left of BLOCKED
        Honest blocked states - Form 138 Q4 layout,
        ECR arrear layout, post-cliff ESI, chronology gap.
    end note
